@startuml
'==== Title ====
title "Active Listings Retrieval" - Level 3 REST Reference SD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' ==== Participants ====
participant ":Backend" as Backend
database ":Database" as db

== Execution for active-direct-sales href ==

[-> Backend : GET /direct-sales/active (via getByHref)
activate Backend

Backend -> db : find active direct sale listings
activate db
db --> Backend : active sales raw data
deactivate db

note over Backend
  Maps domain entities to
  DirectSaleResponseDTOs and builds
  HATEOAS CollectionModel container
end note

[<-- Backend : 200 OK + CollectionModel (Direct Sales)
deactivate Backend

== Execution for auctions href ==

[-> Backend : GET /auctions (via getByHref)
activate Backend

Backend -> db : find active auction listings
activate db
db --> Backend : active auctions raw data
deactivate db

note over Backend
  Maps domain entities to
  AuctionResponseDTOs and adds
  resource-level HATEOAS links
end note

[<-- Backend : 200 OK + List<AuctionResponseDTO>
deactivate Backend

@enduml